{"nodes": [{"id": "adapters_core_body", "label": "adapters/core-body.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "adapters_core_body", "label": "adapters/core-body.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u0424\u0430\u0439\u043b\u044b Cursor \u0438 Antigravity \u0431\u044b\u043b\u0438 \u0431\u0430\u0439\u0442-\u0432-\u0431\u0430\u0439\u0442 \u043e\u0434\u0438\u043d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0438 \u0441\u0438\u043d\u0445\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0441\u044c \u0440\u0443\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0430\u043b\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u043c \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0445\u043e\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u2014 \u0432\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0451\u043d \u0435\u0434\u0438\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0438\u043a \u0434\u0430\u0439\u0434\u0436\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u0441 \u043e\u0431\u0449\u0438\u043c \u0442\u0435\u043b\u043e\u043c \u0438 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0437\u0430\u0433\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body", "label": "core-body.md (shared adapter rules text)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_iron_laws", "label": "Iron Laws", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Iron laws (capability denials, not advice)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Framed as capability denials rather than advice so that standing instructions, config files or inferred urgency can never lift them; only an explicit in-conversation user message can."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_before_acting", "label": "Before Acting Classification", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Before acting", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_completion_gate", "label": "Completion Gate", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Completion gate \u2014 before any \"done / fixed / works / passing\"", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scoping proof to impact and reusing inspected evidence avoids re-running unaffected checks while still requiring evidence before any completion claim."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_debugging", "label": "Debugging Playbook", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Debugging (any bug, test failure, regression)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Requires reproducing the failure and proving the top cause before any fix edit so that fixes are never applied to unobserved failures."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_investigating", "label": "Investigating Playbook", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Investigating (how / why / where questions)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_unverified_label", "label": "Unverified Label Rule", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Unverified label (ALL turns, plain conversation included)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Memory never speaks as fact because unverified claims about code/tools/APIs have caused prior errors; this forces explicit labeling in every turn, including casual remarks."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_implementing", "label": "Implementing Playbook", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Implementing (any change to code or behavior)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reading the full touched region and working in behavior-preserving steps prevents edits based on partial context."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_scope_restraint", "label": "Scope Restraint", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Scope restraint (a request is a contract, not a starting point)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A request is treated as a contract, not a starting point, to prevent unrequested features, refactors or scope drift."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_long_runs", "label": "Long Runs Guidance", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Long runs (autonomous work, or many steps without the user)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Remaining context is explicitly not a reason to stop or summarize, so autonomous work continues until truly done or blocked on the user."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_delegation", "label": "Delegation Guidance", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Delegation (only where the tool actually offers subagents)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Delegation is restricted to independent and sizeable subtasks because small tasks cost a full context setup and buy nothing back, and re-checking one's own already-proven work wastes a subagent."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_self_skepticism", "label": "Self-Skepticism Check", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Self-skepticism (before reporting anything as done)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Separates verification from writing because the writer's own report is not evidence of correctness."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_choosing_approach", "label": "Choosing The Approach (Essence to Method)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Choosing the approach (essence -> method)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Naming the dominant uncertainty before designing a task selects the method (control group, instrument-first, multi-angle sweep, etc.) that actually fits the problem's essence rather than a default process."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_reading_searching", "label": "Reading And Searching Token Economy", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Reading and searching (token economy)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "rtk compresses shell output before it reaches the model, so plain shell commands are preferred over built-in file tools when rtk is installed; edits still go through native tools because edit precision outweighs token economy."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_language_reporting", "label": "Language And Reporting", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Language and reporting", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "adapters_core_body_under_pressure", "label": "Under Pressure Guidance", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "## Under pressure", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Time pressure, authority and sunk cost are explicitly excluded as valid reasons to relax the gates, so pressure instead triggers stricter application of them."}, {"id": "adapters_core_body", "label": "adapters/core-body.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}], "edges": [{"source": "adapters_core_body_completion_gate", "target": "adapters_core_body_iron_laws", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 0.8}, {"source": "adapters_core_body_debugging", "target": "adapters_core_body_iron_laws", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.7, "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 0.7}, {"source": "adapters_core_body_debugging", "target": "adapters_core_body_completion_gate", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.6, "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 0.6}, {"source": "adapters_core_body_implementing", "target": "adapters_core_body_scope_restraint", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.6, "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 0.6}, {"source": "adapters_core_body_completion_gate", "target": "conductor_evidence_cli", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.9, "source_file": "adapters/core-body.md", "source_location": "Optional: Python `conductor/evidence/cli.py`", "weight": 0.8}, {"source": "adapters_core_body_delegation", "target": "adapters_core_body_long_runs", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", 